    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "2 Friary Lane is a charming one-bedroom terraced cottage tucked away in a quiet setting just off Cork Street, only a short stroll from the heart of Kinsale.\n\nUpgraded in recent years, the property offers cosy, well-presented accommodation comprising a living room, fitted kitchen, double bedroom and shower room. The cottage benefits from efficient electric heating with modern timer-controlled Q-Rad radiators.\n\nCombining charm, convenience and low-maintenance living, 2 Friary Lane is ideally suited to first-time buyers, downsizers or those seeking a peaceful holiday home, all within walking distance of the town`s vibrant cafés, restaurants, shops and waterfront.\n\nThe property previously benefited from planning permission for an extension, demonstrating the potential to further develop the cottage, subject to obtaining the necessary planning permission.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Charming one-bedroom terraced cottage </li><li> Prime location just off Cork Street </li><li> Just a short stroll from Kinsale town centre and waterfront </li><li> Compact, low-maintenance home </li><li> Potential to extend (subject to planning permission) </li><li> Ideal first home, holiday home or investment</li></ul>"
      },
